Verified upstream limitation: Upstream exposes the visible Cancel button with the accessible name Dismiss. Its portalled Save changes button has no owning form, so it does not submit. This behavior was reproduced on the official Dialog page and in Col using Chrome 156.0.8078.48. Both controls remain inside the dialog portal; Cancel and Escape close it and restore trigger focus.

